title: Window
---
<<declare $window_interaction_count = 0>>
<<if $window_interaction_count == 0>>
 You looked out the window to see the sun setting. 
 You thought to yourself how a better view may be possible with the time you have left.
 <<set $window_interaction_count+=1>>
<<elseif $window_interaction_count == 1>>
 The wind brushes against your face.
 The fresh breeze feels soft, almost comforting.
 You think about going outside.

 <<set $window_interaction_count+=1>>
<<else>>
 You think about going outside.
<<endif>>
===
